7316 0 obj
<<
/Title (around a well-designed relational database. The schema of 11 tables and one view is in Third Normal Form, protected by primary, foreign and unique keys, CHECK constraints, a generated column and purposeful referential actions. The most important business operation, recording a sale, is a single ACID transaction that locks stock rows, validates availability, writes five tables and rolls back completely on any error. Twenty-two SQL queries demonstrate joins, aggregates, GROUP BY / HAVING, subqueries, ROLLUP, a view and a window function, and the web interface turns these queries into dashboards, reports, invoices and a POS screen. The automated suite of 111 API checks passed in full, which gives confidence that the database rules and the application behave as designed.)
/Dest [68 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6727 0 R
/Prev 7108 0 R
/Next 7109 0 R
>>
endobj
